OL,3,ARussian governor detained in rare
OL,4,Acriminal case against regional leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe governor of Russia's northern
OL,7,FMurmansk region has been arrested on
OL,8,Fcorruption charges in the first
OL,9,Fdetention of a regional leader for five
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FAndrei Chibis, 47, is suspected of
OL,13,Fembezzlement and misappropriation of
OL,14,Fmore than a billion roubles ($12.2.m;
OL,15,F#9.3m) set aside to build an Arctic
OL,16,Fhighway, as well as a further 39m
OL,17,Froubles from the Murmansk construction
OL,18,Fbudget.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
