OL,3,ARussian governor detained in rare
OL,4,Acriminal case against regional leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FChibis is reported to have been
OL,7,Fdetained as he arrived on a visit to
OL,8,FMoscow on Monday and was taken in for
OL,9,Fquestioning.
OL,11,FHe denies wrongdoing but has made no
OL,12,Fpublic comment. His wife Yevgenia
OL,13,FChibis said "anyone who knows our
OL,14,Ffamily understands how ridiculous this
OL,15,Fis".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
